   "line": [
    "Qd2"
   ],
   "spoken": "Don't rush the central knight jump — but keep the key motif in mind: if it's exchanged, recapture with the pawn to pry open d5 for the other knight. Timing that break is what turns a solid position into an initiative.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 24,
   "t": 426,
   "fen": "r3r1k1/pp1n1ppp/2pq1n2/3p1b2/3P4/2N1PN1P/PP1QBPP1/R4RK1 w - - 3 13",
