   "fen": "r3r1k1/pp1n1ppp/2pq4/3p1b2/3Pn3/2N1PN1P/PP1QBPP1/R3R1K1 w - - 5 14",
   "line": [
    "Ne4"
   ],
   "spoken": "Now is the perfect moment for the knight to e4, because after the exchange and pawn recapture the enemy knight can no longer retreat to its home square, and the piece stranded on the rim starts to find itself in real trouble.",
   "kind": "tactic"
  },
  {
   "ply": 28,
   "t": 511,
   "fen": "r3r1k1/pp1n1ppp/2pq4/5b2/3Pp3/4PN1P/PP1QBPP1/R3R1K1 w - - 0 15",
