   "fen": "r3r1k1/1p3ppp/2pq4/p2n1b2/3Pp3/P3P2P/1P1QBPPN/R1R3K1 w - - 0 18",
   "line": [
    "a5"
   ],
   "spoken": "As the opponent prepares to expand, the near-automatic response is a5, meeting the advance head-on and keeping the queenside from opening on the enemy's terms.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 35,
   "t": 779.5,
   "fen": "r3r1k1/1p3ppp/2pq4/p2n1b2/3Pp3/P3P2P/1PRQBPPN/R5K1 b - - 1 18",
